| How does it work? | Disrupts bacterial membranes via amphipathic helix insertion; also modulates immune response |
| Is it effective against resistant bacteria? | Preclinical evidence is promising; ongoing research in resistant strains and biofilms |
| Is it approved for treatment? | No — research is ongoing; not yet cleared for clinical use against AMR infections |
